# AJS admin operator inventory — TEMPLATE, never commit real values.
#
# Strict RBAC format (one person per line):
#   username:viewer|operator|admin:token:password
#
# token: independent random API secret, >=32 chars (`openssl rand -hex 32`).
# password: independent Basic-login secret, >=12 chars; not the API token.
# Neither secret may contain ':'. The daemon receives only SHA-256(token).
# Render with `sudo sh deploy/production/render-admin-operators.sh`, then
# reload nginx and restart ajs-accountd. Password-only edits do not revoke a
# copied API token; remove/rotate its hash and restart the daemon to revoke it.
#
# Migration rotation: a second row for the same name+role with a new token is
# accepted. Reload nginx with only the new mapped token, verify it, restart the
# daemon with both hashes, then remove the retired hash and restart again.
alice:viewer:replace-me-with-openssl-rand-hex-32:replace-me-with-a-long-unique-password
bob:operator:replace-me-with-another-openssl-rand-hex-32:replace-me-with-another-long-unique-password
carol:admin:replace-me-with-a-third-openssl-rand-hex-32:replace-me-with-a-third-long-password
